{"id":"n78662-1-8","stage":5,"title":"실상 · 实际上","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78662-1-8-1","ko":"박 사장 사업이 요즘 힘들어졌다면서?","zh":"听说朴社长最近生意不太好？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"박","meaning":"朴（姓氏）","explanation":"박：朴（姓氏）","readings":[{"term":"박","audio":"/audio/a2ed2af4650eb11ce3b7.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"사장","meaning":"老板，总经理","explanation":"사장：老板，总经理","readings":[{"term":"사장","audio":"/audio/ede38c8825edb7fbd7e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61274","senseId":"1","lemma":"사장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사업이","meaning":"事业，生意","explanation":"사업：事业，生意；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사업","audio":"/audio/7b3733aab2fd0dcf59d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62048","senseId":"1","lemma":"사업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"힘들어졌다면서?","meaning":"变难，变累","explanation":"힘들어지다：变难，变累；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"힘들어지다","audio":"/audio/c1b570e60706ce7b0c9c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88832","senseId":"2","lemma":"힘들어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ede38c8825edb7fb","term":"사장","zh":"老板，总经理","audio":"/audio/ede38c8825edb7fbd7e4.mp3","entryId":"61274","definition":"代表公司对公司事务负责的人。","pronunciation":["사장"]},{"id":"7b3733aab2fd0dcf","term":"사업","zh":"事业，生意","audio":"/audio/7b3733aab2fd0dcf59d4.mp3","entryId":"62048","definition":"为取得经济利益而经营某种组织。","pronunciation":["사ː업"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"c1b570e60706ce7b","term":"힘들어지다","zh":"变难，变累","audio":"/audio/c1b570e60706ce7b0c9c.mp3","entryId":"88832","definition":"比以前难或困难。","pronunciation":["힘드러지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b79df6039f0bcb2c2762.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n78662-1-8-2","ko":"그렇다더군, 실상 돈도 많이 날린 모양이야.","zh":"是啊，据说还损失了不少钱呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇다더군,","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；다더군：把以前听说的情况告诉对方，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"실상","meaning":"实际上，其实","explanation":"실상：实际上，其实","readings":[{"term":"실상","audio":"/audio/8ab9bfc38b81670b281a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78662","senseId":"1","lemma":"실상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돈도","meaning":"钱，钱财","explanation":"돈：钱，钱财；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"3","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날린","meaning":"荡尽，失掉","explanation":"날리다：荡尽，失掉；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"날리다","audio":"/audio/e3a046ffc869c0e067dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16346","senseId":"4","lemma":"날리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모양이야.","meaning":"像，好像","explanation":"모양：像，好像；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"모양","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62398","senseId":"1","lemma":"모양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"8ab9bfc38b81670b","term":"실상","zh":"实际上，其实","audio":"/audio/8ab9bfc38b81670b281a.mp3","entryId":"78662","definition":"在事实上。","pronunciation":["실쌍"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，钱财","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"财物或财产。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"e3a046ffc869c0e0","term":"날리다","zh":"荡尽，失掉","audio":"/audio/e3a046ffc869c0e067dd.mp3","entryId":"16346","definition":"由于失误，把持有的财产或资料等全部失去或耗尽。","pronunciation":["날리다"]},{"id":"f1cd655a5837981f","term":"모양","zh":"像，好像","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3","entryId":"62398","definition":"表示估计或推测。","pronunciation":["모양"]}],"audio":"/audio/068e6357a4e8a925b80d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.22,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=78662","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":153,"sequenceScore":3.0467,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["听说朴社长最近生意不太好？","是啊，据说还损失了不少钱呢。","敏俊啊，你哪里不舒服吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说朴社长最近生意不太好？","是啊，据说还损失了不少钱呢。","敏俊啊，你哪里不舒服吗？"],"answer":1}]}
